{"unit_id":"NoProblUm__dsh-codexlike-projectless#card-zh","repo":"NoProblUm/dsh-codexlike-projectless","commit":"4c818d4ffa6682432b2e6773bde4430edc799e2e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Codexlike Projectless 为 DSH 提供类似 Codex 的无项目会话体验，适用于桌面端。它接入原生会话输入与工作区界面，让用户先写草稿，再在首次发送时按日期和主题创建本地工作目录并提交真实会话。主要功能包括无项目草稿、首次发送建目录、保留原生模型和控制项，以及配置工作区根目录。适合希望不先选项目、直接开始 DSH 会话的用户。需要兼容的 DSH Desktop 构建，并可选设置工作区根目录；不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:1-35","src/client/first-prompt.ts:18-109","src/index.ts:219-233"]}
{"unit_id":"NoProblUm__dsh-codexlike-projectless#card-en","repo":"NoProblUm/dsh-codexlike-projectless","commit":"4c818d4ffa6682432b2e6773bde4430edc799e2e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Codexlike Projectless adds projectless chats to DSH desktop. Users draft first; on first send it creates a local date and topic folder, then submits a session. It keeps native input controls and supports a configurable root. A compatible DSH build is required; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:1-35","src/client/first-prompt.ts:18-109","src/index.ts:219-233"]}
{"unit_id":"NoProblUm__dsh-codexlike-projectless#feature-1","repo":"NoProblUm/dsh-codexlike-projectless","commit":"4c818d4ffa6682432b2e6773bde4430edc799e2e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Codexlike Projectless 的功能「无项目草稿」：在无项目状态使用原生输入框编辑消息；首次发送前不会创建真实 Session、Workspace 或任务目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.zh-CN.md:31-40","src/client/index.tsx:1-35"]}
